              {
                "detail": "The main hook verifies signed feeds, but HEARTBEAT.md fetches the advisory feed with curl, validates only JSON shape, and prints remote title/action text as operational security guidance. The catalog discovery script also accepts a remote catalog URL without signature or hostname restrictions and prints install commands from that data.",
