            "guidance": "Review before installing. Prefer the manual verified install path or a pinned clawhub version, keep CLAWSEC_ALLOW_UNSIGNED_FEED disabled, avoid custom feed/catalog URLs unless you control and verify them, and only enable the persistent hook or cron if you want ongoing security automation in your OpenClaw main session.",
